  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s R.E.D. (Remember Everyone Deployed) Hoodie combines functionality with a heartfelt message of solidarity. Featuring the R.E.D. graphic on the front, this hoodie honors and supports deployed service members. Designed for practicality, the kangaroo pocket includes an internal access point. The right sleeve showcases a US flag graphic with stars facing forward, echoing a uniform.&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132969",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s R.E.D. (Remember Everyone Deployed) Hoodie combines functionality with a heartfelt message of solidarity. Featuring the R.E.D. graphic on the front, this hoodie honors and supports deployed service members. Designed for practicality, the kangaroo pocket includes an internal access point. The right sleeve showcases a US flag graphic with stars facing forward, echoing a uniform. Additional features include zippered pockets on both sleeves, pen slots, and a loop field for patches. The left sleeve also has a wire passthrough port for your headphones. Thumb holes in the cuffs keep the sleeves in place and offer extra coverage. Made from high-performance moisture-wicking material, this hoodie ensures you stay comfortable and dry. The drawstring hood adds to the overall functionality and style, making this sweatshirt a perfect blend of utility and tribute.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
